{"kind":"text","value":"INAIL, within 45 days of the employer's request","text":"Under art. 71, c. 11 of D.Lgs. 81/2008, the employer uses INAIL for the first periodic verification of Annex VII equipment, and INAIL must carry it out within 45 days of the request. If that period passes without action, the employer may choose another qualified public or private body. Art. 2, c. 1 of DM 11 April 2011 gives 60 days instead. I have followed the 45 days in the legislative decree, which is the higher-ranking source and the one stated in its current wording.","used":[1,4]}
